      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Locking and Synchronization",
      "source_hash": 2295693829565288488,
      "context_hash": 3855306764880350124,
      "translation": "락과 동기화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:13.306913Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How the Linux kernel serializes concurrent access to shared data",
      "source_hash": 2791618417986676019,
      "context_hash": 6716265549602614670,
      "translation": "Linux 커널이 공유 데이터에 대한 동시 접근을 직렬화하는 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:13.306914Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Why locking matters",
      "source_hash": 14551585711990845759,
      "context_hash": 17296714995868714518,
      "translation": "락이 중요한 이유",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:13.306914Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux runs on systems with hundreds of CPUs, all sharing kernel data structures.",
      "source_hash": 713547340398611223,
      "context_hash": 1165925120962895286,
      "translation": "Linux는 수백 개의 CPU가 모두 커널 자료 구조를 공유하는 시스템에서 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "data structures": "자료 구조",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:13.306915Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Without synchronization, two CPUs could simultaneously modify a linked list — corrupting its pointers, losing entries, or looping forever.",
      "source_hash": 5255066931697093702,
      "context_hash": 5463852365708498678,
      "translation": "동기화가 없으면 두 CPU가 동시에 연결 리스트를 수정하여 포인터를 손상시키거나, 항목을 잃어버리거나, 무한 루프에 빠질 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:13.306915Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Locking prevents this.",
      "source_hash": 9146060413735554174,
      "context_hash": 5713317624178412857,
      "translation": "락은 이러한 일을 방지합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:13.306915Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel provides a rich set of primitives, each with different performance characteristics and usage contexts:",
      "source_hash": 3136832295236446040,
      "context_hash": 3820897841829781724,
      "translation": "커널은 다양한 프리미티브를 제공하며, 각 프리미티브는 성능 특성과 사용 맥락이 서로 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:13.306916Z",
      "issues": []
    },
